  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints : } g^{\\prime}=\\frac{g}{\\left(1+\\frac{h}{\\mathrm{R}}\\right)^2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{g}{100}=\\frac{g}{\\left(1+\\frac{h}{\\mathrm{R}}\\right)^2} \\\\\n& 1+\\frac{h}{\\mathrm{R}}=10 \\Rightarrow \\frac{h}{\\mathrm{R}}=9, h=9 \\mathrm{R}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
